    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "29561a20cc2d589f753e": "Elder Rumblerock passes the years in a cave atop Dreadmaul Rock in the Burning Steppes.",
        "2bac7604ae88addacd07": "In days long past, we lived for the hunt.  We hunted for glory, for honor...$B$BIs it so different now?",
        "77389783717cf2e52f41": "Last I knew, Elder Starsong was in the Sunken Temple of the Swamp of Sorrows.",
        "ba4bdeef828d1f1a1b06": "You'll find Elder Starglade outside the gates to Zul'Gurub in Stranglethorn Vale.",
        "f38ee0dca33efa1d54c2": "Elder Skychaser looks out over Westfall from atop Sentinel Hill."
      },
      "name": "Elder Winterhoof",
      "translationMetadata": {
